previews, and structured JSON/Markdown indexes in this repository are dedicated
to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

Interactive sheet music player, 60fps Waterfall Piano visualizer, Wait-for-Key
MIDI/Microphone practice mode, and full SVG/MIDI/MusicXML downloads are hosted
free of charge at:
https://nextscore.org/

